[
  {
    "name": "抗剪疲劳计算主流程",
    "width": 1560,
    "height": 2630,
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "start",
        "text": "开始：定义一个抗剪疲劳算例",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 60,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 70,
        "kind": "round",
        "color": "FFE9CD"
      },
      {
        "id": "input",
        "text": "输入试件、材料、黏结参数与峰谷总荷载\n目标剪力：Vmax=Qmax/2；Vmin=Qmin/2\nparameters / read_and_calculate",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 170,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 110,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "E7F0FF"
      },
      {
        "id": "init",
        "text": "计算真实交点、两侧锚固长度与箍筋位置\n初始化 N=0、最大滑移、局部龄期和失效记录\nprepare_parameters / fatigue_calculate",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 320,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 110,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "E7F0FF"
      },
      {
        "id": "initial",
        "text": "依次求初始峰值、谷值平衡（局部求解见第2页）\nVc(q)+Vs(q)+Vf(q)=Qmax/2 或 Qmin/2\n可选 capacity_scan 仅作初始静力诊断",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 470,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 110,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "E5F3E9"
      },
      {
        "id": "initok",
        "text": "初始峰、谷状态\n都求解成功？",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 620,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 100,
        "kind": "diamond",
        "color": "FFE9CD"
      },
      {
        "id": "limit",
        "text": "N < Nmax？",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 765,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 100,
        "kind": "diamond",
        "color": "FFE9CD"
      },
      {
        "id": "active",
        "text": "由峰谷滑移确定疲劳活跃节点\n曾激活或 smax>ηδm，且滑移差>容差（η默认0.75）\nactive_nodes｜[F19：阈值；其余为实现规则]",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 905,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 110,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "E7F0FF"
      },
      {
        "id": "on",
        "text": "有活跃节点，或启用了\n箍筋/混凝土 S–N 规则？",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 1055,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 110,
        "kind": "diamond",
        "color": "FFE9CD"
      },
      {
        "id": "step",
        "text": "选择循环块 ΔN\n不超过cycleStep、剩余循环数与下一快照位置\nfatigue_calculate",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 1205,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 100,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "E7F0FF"
      },
      {
        "id": "proposal",
        "text": "从已接受历史建立候选历史，不覆盖原历史\n活跃节点：Nloc,new=Nloc,old+ΔN\n可选S–N/Miner更新；默认关闭",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 1345,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 110,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "E7F0FF"
      },
      {
        "id": "peak",
        "text": "按候选龄期更新 τm，并重新求峰值平衡\nτm=max{0,τm0[1−kf log₁₀max(Nloc,1)]} [F19式2]\nstate → trial → bond_strength / anchorage",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 1495,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 120,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "E5F3E9"
      },
      {
        "id": "retry",
        "text": "峰值失败或 q 增长过快，\n并且 ΔN > 1？",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 1655,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 110,
        "kind": "diamond",
        "color": "FFE9CD"
      },
      {
        "id": "peakok",
        "text": "候选峰值平衡成功？",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 1805,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 100,
        "kind": "diamond",
        "color": "FFE9CD"
      },
      {
        "id": "valley",
        "text": "继承候选峰值的最大滑移历史，求谷值平衡\nVc(qmin)+Vs(qmin)+Vf(qmin)=Qmin/2\nstate（卸载）",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 1945,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 110,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "E5F3E9"
      },
      {
        "id": "lowok",
        "text": "候选谷值平衡成功？",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 2095,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 100,
        "kind": "diamond",
        "color": "FFE9CD"
      },
      {
        "id": "commit",
        "text": "接受循环块：N←N+ΔN，提交候选历史\n记录抗剪分量、裂缝位移、残差及失效标志\nhistory_row / save_snapshot",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 2235,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 110,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "E7F0FF"
      },
      {
        "id": "output",
        "text": "结束并输出最后有效结果\nexport_results：曲线、局部场、MAT / CSV / PNG",
        "x": 430,
        "y": 2405,
        "w": 570,
        "h": 100,
        "kind": "round",
        "color": "FFE9CD"
      },
      {
        "id": "runout",
        "text": "达到 Nmax\n标记 runout，不代表已破坏",
        "x": 50,
        "y": 765,
        "w": 300,
        "h": 100,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "FFE9CD"
      },
      {
        "id": "inactive",
        "text": "无可演化的退化项\n沿快照记录至 Nmax\n标记无活跃退化runout",
        "x": 50,
        "y": 1055,
        "w": 300,
        "h": 120,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "FFE9CD"
      },
      {
        "id": "half",
        "text": "ΔN←max[1, floor(ΔN/2)]\n回到同一份已接受历史重试",
        "x": 1120,
        "y": 1345,
        "w": 330,
        "h": 100,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "E7F0FF"
      },
      {
        "id": "initialstop",
        "text": "初始求解未成功\n记录初始模型限制或数值诊断",
        "x": 1120,
        "y": 620,
        "w": 330,
        "h": 110,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "FFE2DE"
      },
      {
        "id": "stop",
        "text": "记录停止原因\n数值不收敛 ≠ 物理破坏\n无指定分支平衡根＝模型限制\n保留最后已接受状态",
        "x": 1120,
        "y": 2075,
        "w": 330,
        "h": 150,
        "kind": "box",
        "color": "FFE2DE"
      }
    ],
